<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2TIM</book>
  <para style="h">2 TEMCEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Temceo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Temceo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tem</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">TEMCEO</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Temceo, opong ki tam amiya bot Temceo macalo latic lawote dok lawange bene. Lok ma pire tek kany en aye lok me diyo cwiny. Paulo ocoyo waraga man me cuko cwiny Temceo me mede ki miyo cadene ikom Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. Paulo olego Temceo me mako liking pwony me ada me Kwena Maber ki pwony ducu ma a ki igin acoya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ocuku bene cwiny Temceo me mako dog tice macalo lapwony makwiri kadi bed ayelayela tye dok jo mukene tye kakwero tektek Kwena Maber ma mako kom Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo olego Temceo pe me rwako wiye i pyem ki laro lok ma pe konyo niye, pien balo niye pa dano abala.</para>
  <para style="ip">Me agiki ne Paulo olego Temceo me neno lanyut maber ki bote. Gin aye bedo ki mar, diyo cwiny, ciro can ki kit ayelayela ducu ma bino ikom latic pa Lubanga ma cwinye leng dok tiyo maber.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Mot bot Temceo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo opwoyo niye pa Temceo ki ocuku cwinye <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3—2:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Miyo tam ki ciko Temceo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14—4:5</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gin ma Paulo owok ki iye <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mot me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Tic 16:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Waraga man oa ki bot Paulo ma lakwena pa Kricito Yecu pi mit pa Lubanga, malube ki cikene me miyowa kwo ma wok ki i Kricito Yecu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Bot Temceo latina ma amaro: Lubanga Won ki Kricito Yecu Rwotwa omini gum, kica ki kuc.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwoc ki cuku cwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Apwoyo Lubanga ma atiyo bote tic ki tam maleng, macalo kwariwa yam gutiyo bote, kun alwongo nyingi ilegana me kare ducu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ka apo pig wangi, miyo i dyeceng ki dyewor aparo me neni, wek apong ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Apo ikom niyeni ma goba pe iye, mayam kong okwongo bedo bot dani Loi, ki meni Yuneki, ma angeyo atir ma pe akalo akala ni tye boti bene. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Man omiyo apoyo wi me tic ki cwinyi ducu ki mot me kica mayam Lubanga omiyo ki in ikare ma aketo cinga iwii. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Pien Lubanga yam pe omiyowa cwiny me lworo, ento omiyowa cwiny me teko ki me mar ki me juke kenwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Pimeno lewic pe omaki me miyo caden ikom Rwotwa, lewic bene pe omaki ikoma, an ma abedo lamabuceni, ento ribe kwedwa iciro can pi lok me Kwena Maber, iteko pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />En olarowa dok olwongowa me bedo jo maleng, pe pi tic mogo ma wan watiyo, ento pi lubu yub ma mere, ki pi kicane mayam en omiyo botwa i Kricito Yecu i acaki piny. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Kombedi dong kinyutu woko botwa ibino pa Lalarwa Kricito Yecu madong okwanyo to woko matwal, ci omiyo kwo ma bedo matwal onen woko kamaleng pi lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1 Tem 2:7</ref> </char></note> Pi lok me Kwena Maberi, oweko yam kiketa abedo latit lok, lakwena ki lapwony bene. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Man en aye gin ma omiyo aneno can kit macalo atye ka nenone wa i kareni. Ento lewic pe maka gira, pien angeyo ngat ma aye, dok bene ageno atirni, en twero gwoko gin ma omiyo i cinga nio i Nino maca. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Nen ni imako pwony me ada mayam iwinyo ki bota, kun ilubu kwede niye ki mar matye i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Gwok gin maber ma kimiyo i cingi pi kony ma Cwiny Maleng ma bedo i iwa miyowa.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />In i ngeyoni, jo ducu matye i Acia dong guloko ngegi woko bota. Pugelo gin ki Kermogen gitye ikin gi. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Alego Rwot ni omyero otim kica ikom paco pa Oneciporo, pien yam obedo ka dwoko cwinya tyen mapol. Lewic pe omake pi twec ma kitweya kwede ki nyor, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />ento ikare ma en oo i Roma oyenya matek nio ka ononga. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Rwot omyero omii en onong kica ma a ki bote i Nino maca. Dok in bene ingeyo maber mada kit kony ma en obedo ka miyone i Epeco.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Acikari pa Yecu Kricito ma lawiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Latina, in dong ibed matek i kica ma kimiyowa i Kricito. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Pwony madong ityeko winyo ki bota inyim lucaden mapol, in bene myero itit bot jo ma gene ma giromo pwonyo ki jo mukene. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Cir arem me gin marac ma kitimo ikomi, macalo acikari pa Yecu Kricito ma lawiny. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Acikari matye i dog tice tame tye ni myero eyom cwiny ladite, piman en dok pe a woko kun dok rwake itiyo tic mo mukene mapat. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Lapyem ituku pe twero loyo tuku ka pe olubu cik me tuku meno kikome. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Lapur ma en latic matek i potone en aye ma omyero okwong camo gin ma ocek iye. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Tam gin ma aloko, pien Rwot bimiyo iniang i iye ducu.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Po ikom Yecu Kricito, ma ocer ki ikin jo ma oto, en lakwar Daudi, kit macalo an atito kwede lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Lok meno me Kwena Maber en aye gin ma atye ka ciro can pire, kun kitweya woko ki nyor calo kitweyo labalo! Ento pe kitweyo lok pa Lubanga gire. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Meno en gin ma omiyo atye ka ciro arem kare ducu, pi jo ma ki yero, wek gin bene gunong lare matye i Kricito Yecu, kacel ki deyo ma pe gik. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Lok man lok ada ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Ka wato kwede, wabikwo kwede bene,<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luk 12:9</ref> </char>
    </note> ka waciro can, wabibedo kaloc kacel kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">ka wakwere, en bene bikwerowa;<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />ka wan jo ma pe gene, en gire gene nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">pien en pe twero kwere kene.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latic ma kipwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Po wigi ikom lok man, dok icikgi inyim Rwot ni gin guwek pyem ite lok mapatpat, pien meno pe konyo gin mo, ento dok mede me balo jo ma winyo abala. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ket tek kit macalo itwero pi mine keni bot Lubanga macalo ngat ma kipwoyo, latic ma pe ki gin mo ma lewic myero omake iye, ma pwonyo lok me ada i yo ma atir. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Kwer boko lok ma pe me woro Lubanga, pien lok ma kitmeno mede ki rwenyo dano arwenya iworo Lubanga, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />dok bene lokgi bitucu yone calo bur ma camo kom dano oyotoyot. Kumenayo gin ki Pileto gitye ikin jo meno. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Dong gungak woko ki ilok ada kun giwaco ni wan dong wacer con. Man gin tye ka balo kwede niye pa jo mogo. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Wel 16:5</ref> </char></note> Ento guti me pwony man Lubanga dong oketo tye ma ocung woko matek liking, ma bene tye ki coc man ikome ni, “Rwot ngeyo jo ma gin jone kikome,” dok ni, “Dano acel acel ma lwongo nying Rwot omyero opoke woko ki ibal.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />I ot mo madit, pe bedo iye jami me jabu ki ryal keken, ento bedo iye bene jami mogo ma kitiyo ki bao ki ma kitiyo ki lobo; mogo kitiyo kwedgi ikare me deyo keken, ento mukenegu kitiyo kwedgi ikare ducu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Kace ngat mo olonye kekene, kun oweko bedo ki kit marac woko, en bibedo atabo ma kitiyo kwede ikare me deyo, ma bedo maleng, ma konyo won ot, ma oyube pi tic ducu maber. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Wek miti me bulu obedi, ento ket tami ibedo ki kit ma atir, niye, mar ki kuc, kacel ki jo ducu ma kok bot Rwot kun igi leng. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Kwer pyem me mingomingo ma bino pi kwiya pinygu woko; in i ngeyoni kodi pyem macalo meno kelo da. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Latic pa Rwot myero obed ngat ma pe daa atata, myero obed ngat ma lakica bot dano ducu, lapwony ma ladiro, ngat ma diyo cwinye, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />ngat ma tiro jo ma pyem kwede ki mwolo. Gwok nyo Lubanga bimiyogi cwiny me ngut, ka wek dong guniang maber ikom lok ada, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />miyo ryekogi dwogo, ci gibwot ki i owic pa Catan ma onongo yam omakogi, omiyo gutiyo gin ma en mito.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kare me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Ento omyero kong iniang man ni, ikare me agiki, peko bibedo madwong. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Pien dano bibedo ka mare ken gi kun gibedo lumar lim, luwake, lucac, lunywar jo mukene. Pe gibiwinyo lunyodogi, pe gibimiyo pwoc mo, gibibedo jo ma pe leng. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Pe gibimaro dano wadgi, gibibedo jo ma pe timo kica bot dano, gibibedo lucok dog, jo ma mitigi pe juke, jo ma ger ma gidag gin mo maber, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />luroro, jo matye atata ma pe giparo piny, jo ma gikete malo ken gi ki wake, jo ma maro yomcwiny ma ka maro Lubanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Gibimako dini dok gibilubu ikitgi manen ki woko keken, kun gikwero tekone woko. Poke woko ki ikom jo macalo meno. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Pien tye jo mogo ikin gi ma giride gidonyo i paco pa dano mukene, ci giloyo tam pa mon mogo ma goro, ma peko me bal obwoyogi woko, ma mitigi tye patpat ci bedo ka ywayogi tungi ki tungi, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />kun gimito pwonye ikare ducu, ento pe dok gitwero niang ilok ada. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Nia 7:11</ref> </char></note> Jo meno girom ki Yane ki Yambure mayam gupyem ki Moses, pien gin bene gitye ka pyem ki lok ada ikit acelu; ryekogi dong obale woko, niyegi bene pe tye kakare. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ento pe gibimede kwede nakanaka, pien mingoginu bingene woko bot lwak, calo pa Yane gin ki Yambure.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik pa Paulo me agiki bot Temceo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ento in dong ilubu pwonya, kita ki gin ma amito tiyone i kwo man. Ineno niyena, diyo cwinya, mar ma atye kwede, kit ma ayele kwede kun aciro can. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Tic 13:14-52</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:1-7">Tic 14:1-7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:8-20">Tic 14:8-20</ref> </char></note> Ineno bene kit ma kiuna kwede, ki can ma aneno; dok ingeyo gin ma otime ikoma i Antiokia, i Ikonio, ki Licitra, kit ayelayela mayam aciro; ento Rwot olara ki i gin ducu. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />I ada, jo ma gimito bedo ma gilworo Lubanga, kun gibedo i Kricito Yecu, kibiunugi, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />kun jo maracu ki jo ma lugoba gibimede ki bedo marac makato kare, kun gibwolo dano, ki gin bene kibibwologi. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ento in myero imede igin ma kipwonyi kwede, ki madong iye adada, kun ingeyo bene jo mayam gupwonyi iye. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Ingeyo bene ni, cake i tinoni ingeyo coc maleng mayam kicoyo matwero pwonyi i yo me lare pi ye Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ginacoya ducu mayam kicoyo, kicoyo pi teko pa Cwiny pa Lubanga. Man konyo me pwony, me juku dano, me tiro kit pa dano, me nyebo dano wek gulub kit ma atir, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />wek dano pa Lubanga obed muteggi, ma bene oyube i yo ducu, maromo tiyo kit tic mo maber ducu.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Aciko in inyim Lubanga ki inyim Kricito Yecu ma bingolo kop pa jo makwo ki jo ma oto, dok pi dwogone ki pi loce, ni meno, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />itit lok pa Lubanga, cung iye matek ikare maber ki ikare marac, mi dano guniang maber, jukgi kun icuku cwinygi i pwony ikare ma ipwonygi kun idiyo cwinyi i yo ducu. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Pien kare tye kabino ma dano dong pe biciro pwony me ada, ento itgi bibedo kayilo ayila, kun gicoko lupwony matwero pwonyogi ki gin ma gimito winyone. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Gibiloko ngegi wek pe giwiny lok ada, kun gingak woko giwire ilok ma tere peke. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ento in omyero ibed ma wi twolo; cir can ka opoto ikomi, tii tic me tito lok me Kwena Maber, dok icob tici ducu kakare.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />An dong dano cok neka woko calo gitum me atyera iwi keno tyer; karena dong oo me weko lobo man. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Dong atyeko lwenyo lweny maber, atyeko cobo ngweca, dok agwoko bene niye. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Kombedi dong kikano pira mot pi kit ma atir, ma Rwot ma ngolo kop atir bimiya inino maca; pe bota keken, ento bot jo ducu madong cwinygi tye ka paro pi dwogone bene. <figure style="fig" alt="The crown of righteousness" file="5600408.TIF" size="col" copy="Ann Valton" ref="4:8">Mot bot Paulo pi kit ma atir</figure><verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Paulo ociko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Tem ki tweroni ducu me bino bota oyotoyot. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">2 Kor 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tit 1:4</ref> </char></note> Pien Dema dong oweka woko pi maro jami me lobo ni, ocito gire woko i Tecalonika; Kurecen ocito mere i Galatia, ki Tito ocito i Dalmatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Tic 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref> </char></note> Luka kene aye odong tye kweda kany. Wubin wun ki Marako, pien en ber tutwal dok konya. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Tic 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Epe 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref> </char></note> Aoro Tukiko ocito i Epeco. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Tic 20:6</ref> </char></note> Ka ibino, kela ki bongo mayam aweko i Teroa i gang pa Karpo. Kwoka bene buka, makatone maca me del ca. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1 Tem 1:20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Jab 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref> </char></note> Alegijanda latet mola otima marac tutwal; Rwot bicule malube ki kit timenu. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />In bene omyero item gwoke ikom nyer nu, pien en yam opyem ki lokwa matek mada. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />I pidona mukwongo, dano mucung pira obedo pe. Jo ducu guringo gutenya woko liyak. Lubanga omyero pe okwan lok man iwigi. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ento Rwot ocungo ka ngeta, ka dong omiya teko me tucu lok kakare, wek Lurok ducu guwiny. Kitmeno en olara ki i dog labwor. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Rwot bikonya miyo aa woko ki i gin maracu ducu, kun lara wek ao i ker ma mere me polo. Deyo obed bote nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Tic 18:2</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2 Tem 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref> </char>
    </note> Mot Pricika gin ki Akwila, ki jo me ot pa Oneciporo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Tic 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Tic 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref> </char></note> Eracto mere yam odong i Korint; Tropimo aweko tye ka two i Mileto. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ket tek io ma kare me koyo peya ocake. Yubulo omoti, kadi ki Puden ki Lino, ki Kalaudia, kacel ki utmegiwa ducu.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Rwot obed i kwoni. Kicane obed kwedwu.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>